Package: ECMExplainerApp
Title: ECMExplainer Shiny Application
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eleanor", "Sheekey", email = "eleanor.sheekey@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Roberto A.", "Avelar", email = "roberto.avelar@example.com",
           role = "aut"))
Description: A modular Shiny application for predicting fibroblast phenotypic
    states from bulk RNA-seq data (human or mouse). Users can train a custom
    ECMExplainer model through the Training Wizard and evaluate new samples
    via the Test Wizard. The pipeline uses ECM gene-expression ratios with
    dual-panel PCA and LDA classification, and supports batch correction via
    ComBat (sva) and limma. Model bundles (.rds) and parameter logs (.json)
    can be saved and restored.
